  "description": "Large Four Bed House Available to Rent\r\n\r\nThere's space for everyone in these stunning, larger-than-standard, lifelong homes. \r\nHouses at Hollywoodrath are surrounded by acres of magnificent parkland. Just north of Blanchardstown, find the perfect balance between the serene countryside and the practicality of city living. \r\n\r\nThese A-rated detached and semi-detached houses have been carefully planned to help you make the most of life at home. \r\nEnjoy versatile spaces for relaxing and entertaining, spacious gardens, generous driveways and stunning landscaped surrounds. \r\n\r\nThis highly sought-after area finds the perfect blend of excellent amenities locally, beautiful rural green surrounding scenery and speedy links to Dublin city centre. \r\n\r\nOn your doorstep, make the most of the shops and restaurants in nearby Blanchardstown, a selection of primary and secondary schools, premier sporting venues and much more. \r\n\r\nStandard features of Occu Hollywoodrath include:\r\n- A2/A3 energy ratings\r\n- Side entrance gates\r\n- Attic trusses\r\n- Wired for TV, telephone and broadband\r\n- Excellent heat efficiency\r\n- Ensuite bathrooms in every house\r\n\r\nAt Occu, we believe that renting should be better. That's why we're working hard to bring you the best: smarter, benefit focused and centred around the needs of our residents. \r\nNo uncertainty, no hidden costs, stunning homes (and we'll let your pets move in too!)\r\n\r\nPlease note, photos may not be specific to this house, but all houses are finished to similar standard. \r\n\r\nOccu. Better renting. That's different. \r\n\r\nOccu PSRA License No: 004136",
